"\n"
"|: turn 180 degrees\n"
"\n"
"[: remember point\n"
"\n"
"]: return to remembered point\n"
"\n"
"Multiple rules can be provided by \n"
"separating them with a semicolon (;).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" वअथ छह यीवान बनावनअ. लागनअ. सीत \n"
"क़ोनून अेकज़िेम बदलअ.\n"
"यइम कमांड छह परज़नावनअ\n"
